ol flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2e4e70b6-a8aa-4842-a6b5-036901f6efcc\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #c2e0f4;\"><strong>MLI每周新闻来了！</strong></span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">我们很高兴地宣布，我们全新的每周新闻系列已经在Instagram故事上线！</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">请关注我们的Instagram，获取最新动态，别忘了每周查看我们的故事！</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">查看我们的最新故事，请点击这里: <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/</a></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\"><br /></span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #374151; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color: #0000fa; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #82f507;\"><strong>MLI活动:</strong></span><br />每逢周二和周五，加入我们在洛杉矶学校举办的充满冒险和乐趣的活动日吧！<br />别错过有关MLI活动的详细信息，点击下面的链接查看：<br /></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font