gle.com/file/d/1RQXyuoj3XtJl9_SUUMLXxzcJDjWsya7H/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Program Takvimi (Hollywood)</a></strong></span><strong><br /><br /></strong></span></p>',12,NULL,'2026-02-05 19:09:34'),(13,'<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"40ceaef0-fcfc-4c17-a472-95fb49df2560\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #c2e0f4;\"><strong>MLI W&ouml;chentliche Nachrichten sind da!</strong></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\">Wir freuen uns, die Einf&uuml;hrung unserer brandneuen w&ouml;chentlichen Nachrichtenserie in Instagram Stories bekannt zu geben! </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\">Folge uns auf Instagram, um die neuesten Updates zu erhalten, und vergiss nicht, jede Woche unsere Stories zu checken!</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sieh dir hier unsere neueste Story an: <span style=\"color: #0000fa;\"><a style=\"color: #0000fa;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/</a></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br /></span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #82f507;\"><strong>MLI Aktivit&auml;ten:</strong></span><br />Entdecke mit unseren schulischen Aktivit&auml;ten das Beste von Los Angeles an einem abenteuerreichen Wochentag oder einem spa&szlig;igen Freitag!<br />Hier findest du weitere Informationen zu unseren Aktivit&auml;ten:</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #0c3bef;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><br /></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; background-color: #ffffff;\">&rarr; </span></span><a style=\"color: #0c3bef;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15BRXRbXb7HO3irbxQusNCVOH8a7BUewy/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MLI-Aktivit&auml;tskalender &ndash; Dieser Monat</a></span></strong><br /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #0c3bef; background-color: #ffffff;\">&rarr;</span><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; color: #0c3bef;\"> </span></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"color: #0710fc;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a style=\"color: #0710fc;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15XKLJcIhUTx4cywJXi7EP6zvJALNF9yX/view?usp=sharing\">MLI-Aktivit&auml;tskalender &ndash; N&auml;chster Monat</a></span></strong><br /><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #374151; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fabcf3;\"><strong>Programmplan:</strong></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Entdecke gro&szlig;artiges Lernen vor Ort an unseren MLI-Campusen in Westwood und Hollywood.<br />Wir setzen Sicherheitsma&szlig;nahmen zum Schutz der Gesundheit von Sch&uuml;lern, Personal und Dozenten um. <br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; white-space: pre-wrap;\">F&uuml;r weitere Einzelheiten verwenden Sie bitte den folgenden Link, um die Programmpl&auml;ne von MLI anzuzeigen:<br /></span></span><span style=\"color: #004eff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">&rarr; &nbsp;<a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d91S4-qq0Znn_1qtoj7rdMeJ23zIATxq/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Programmplan (Westwood)</a></span><br /><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">&rarr; &nbsp;<a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RQXyuoj3XtJl9_SUUMLXxzcJDjWsya7H/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Programmplan (Hollywood)</a></span><br /><br /></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:222b0c4a-1fed-4432-8060-12905f99f5f0-49\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-18\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"text-center\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>',13,NULL,'2026-02-05 19:10:41'),(14,'<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #200cf7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c2e0f4;\"><strong>MLI 每週新聞來了！</strong></span><br />我們很高興宣佈在 Instagram 故事中推出全新的每週新聞系列！<br />追蹤我們的 Instagram 以獲取最新消息，別忘了每週查看我們的故事！<br />查看我們的最新故事： <span style=\"color: #0000fa;\"><a style=\"color: #0000fa;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/mentorlanguageinstitute/</a></span><br /><br /><span style=\"background-color: #82f507;\"><strong>MLI 活動：</strong></span><br />參加我們充實的平日冒險或充滿樂趣的星期五學校活動！和我們一起體驗洛杉磯的最佳活動！ 了解更多詳情，請點擊以下連結查看活動：</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #2107f8;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0c3bef;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\"><br /></span></span></span></span><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\">&rarr;&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #0c3bef;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15BRXRbXb7HO3irbxQusNCVOH8a7BUewy/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本月 MLI 活動行事曆</a><br /></span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; color: #2107f8; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: #0c3bef;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat;\">&rarr;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a style=\"background-repeat: no-repeat; color: #0c3bef; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15XKLJcIhUTx4cywJXi7EP6zvJALNF9yX/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下月 MLI 活動行事曆</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.295; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #374151; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fabcf3;\"><strong>課程時間表：</strong></span><br />在MLI的Westwood校區和Hollywood校區提供提供令人驚嘆的面對面學習。<br />在兩個校區，MLI 都採取了安全措施來保護學生、教職員工的健康。<br /><br />了解更多詳細，請點進去以下鏈接查看MLI的課程時間表：<br /></span><span style=\"color: #0000ff; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&rarr; <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d91S4-qq0Znn_1qtoj7rdMeJ23zIATxq/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">課程時間表（Westwood）</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; color: #0000ff;\">&rarr; <a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RQXyuoj3XtJl9_SUUMLXxzcJDjWsya7H/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">課程時間表（Hollywood）</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b8384089-7fff-7254-c41f-6660e0acabe0\"></span></p>',14,NULL,'2026-02-05 18:51:50');
