sfer school. \nI would like to know about online tuition. I’m F1 student.\nHow much is the cheapest tuition for F1 student?\nHow many months do I need to transfer? Because I need to go back current school after finding your school. \nis there Japanese adviser there?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-06 00:29:29','2022-03-06 00:29:29'),(326,'ÇAĞRI GÖKÇEN','cagrigokcen7@gmail.com','05443966213',0,'Turkey','Hollywood','six months','Internet','Please specify the class times and days. Also, can you write how many days of the week and how many hours, with their fees, thank you. I also wonder what country the students are from',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-06 19:58:51','2022-03-06 19:58:51'),(327,'渡邊岳登','sakana042004@icloud.com','4252128684',0,'United States','Hollywood','three months','Internet','今、ワシントン州のコミュニティカレッジのESLの授業を取っているのですが、今の学校をやめてMLIに学校を変更することは可能ですか？　ビザは持っています。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-07 02:18:15','2022-03-07 02:18:15'),(328,'Sean W Nozaki','seannozaki@gmail.com','3237080274',0,'Japan','Hollywood','three months','An agent','Test',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-07 05:03:06','2022-03-07 05:03:06'),(329,'Poula Farahat','pola.farahat@yahoo.com','+966533798752',0,'Saudi Arabia','Hollywood','six months','Internet','Hello dear, \nI am egyptian working now in Saudi Arabia and I\'d like to start studying with MLI this year enhance my English language which has great impact on my career ..\nRegards, \nPoula Farahat',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-07 12:08:14','2022-03-07 12:08:14'),(330,'Gabriel','gabrielpordeus1@hotmail.com','+5512988329812',0,'Brazil','Westwood','six months','Other','Já conheço a escola, minha irma frequentou e trabalhou nessa unidade em 2019 e gostaria de poder fazer um curso ESL no período de 24 semanas. Minha proposta seria de U$ 3.200,00.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-07 19:12:29','2022-03-07 19:12:29'),(331,'Robert Caldas Sanches de Moura','robertcsm1999@gmail.com','+55 21 990378664',0,'Brazil','Westwood','six months','Internet','Bom dia! Me c