ld like to have private (single) accomodation.\n\nAnd visa issue…i have touristic visa, i am from Ukraine and dont know how to open F1 visa because its war in my country. Is it possible to come with tourists visa and prolonger it in USA for studying english? Or i can just studying with touristic visa in my case?\n\nThank you in advance for your help!\n\nBest regards\n\nVitaliy',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-13 19:19:09','2022-03-13 19:19:09'),(340,'Meriem Chaib','chaib.meriem@hotmail.fr','0658299998',0,'France','Hollywood','one month','An agent','Hi \n\nI’m going to Los Angeles in 2 months (May 12) and I would like to take some English lessons there to improve my oral expression for a period of 1 to 2 weeks. So, I would like to have  some information about prices and registration.\n\nThanks in advance \n\nMeriem',0,'Googleads_FR',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-14 10:18:36','2022-03-14 10:18:36'),(341,'aimee','aimee@studydiy.com.tw','+886988093368',0,'Taiwan','Westwood','six months','An agent','Dear whom may concern,\n\nGood Afternoon!\nI have a potential student who is very interested in MLI in San Francisco Centre today! He supposed he may start his course from the end of May or the beginning of June 2022 till November or December( about six months as an F1 visa student). Would you check if there is a single room vacancy in the school dorm for him, please? Thanks a million!!!\n\nIf possible please let me know the closest date he could check-in. The most ideal time is from 28th May (Sat.)... \n\nThank you very much for your help!!\nHave a nice day!?\nBest regards,\nAimee',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-14 13:13:40','2022-03-14 13:13:40'),(342,'Rafael','rafaelma13@gmail.com','11995898212',0,'Brazil','Both','three months','Internet','Gostaria de mais informações sobre os cursos e custo',0,'Googleads_PR',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-14 16:59:11','2022-03-14 16:59:11'),(343,'Manuk Amirkhanyan','Manukamirkhanyanjan1999@gmail.com','747 476 0131',1,'Other','Hollywood','three months','Friend','he