','2022-03-16 02:36:46'),(349,'Bevelacqua','viviane.kiepe@sfr.fr','0623085170',0,'France','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Recherche campus pour ado 16ans mis Angeles pour 4 semaine pour perfect anglais',0,'Googleads_FR',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-16 16:46:36','2022-03-16 16:46:36'),(350,'藤原　康孝','yasutaka.blaw@gmail.com','08067831994',0,'Japan','Both','one month','Friend','今現在サンディエゴの語学学校に滞在しています。\n現在の語学学校を辞めてMentorに転入を検討しています。\n\n現在の学校を辞めるとI20を破棄し、日本へ14日以内に帰国しなければいけないのですが、\n転入する場合再度I20を取得しなければいけないのでしょうか？',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-16 21:22:18','2022-03-16 21:22:18'),(351,'Nayrobi Gomez','nayrobigp@gmail.com','8090000000',1,'Other','Both','three months','Internet','Buenas. Estoy interesada en un curso del Programa ESL. Desde República Dominicana, durante 6 meses.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-18 16:56:15','2022-03-18 16:56:15'),(352,'Evelyn','e.evelynsr@hotmail.com','6181014154',1,'Other','Westwood','one month','Internet','Hi, I\'d like to get information about an intensive english course. There\'s one thing I want to know about the F1 visa, I\'ll be in LA with my B2 visa only for less than 6 months, is it possible to get in the course with that? Or is too necessary apply for the student visa.\n\nI\'ll wait for your answer, thank you :)',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-18 18:08:14','2022-03-18 18:08:14'),(353,'Denis','Rendenal@mail.ru','+77',1,'Russia','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hello.\n \nI am considering your school.\nPlease answer my questions:\n \nIs the school currently open or has it switched to online distance learning? Will there be any changes in this in the near future?\nMy English is not very good - will I study, will I understand the teacher and make progress in my studies?\nWill there be different students with me in class every day?\nWhat is the total cost of esl+cmar course for 8 weeks  including everything (textbooks, any additional fees...) ?\nWhat are the school requirements?\nHow much should I show for you in my bank account?\nWhat do I need to pay before applying for a visa?\nCan I pay the sevis fee and other fees with my UnionPay card? Or any other than visa and mastercard.\nIs it possible to get a refund (to UnionPay card) if the visa is not approved?\nIs it obligatory to study for a certain period or can I study for an arbitrary number of weeks?\n \nThank you!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-19 03:31:01','2022-03-19 03:31:01'),(354,'かわのあゆみ','all_that_she_wants_19xx@yahoo.co.jp','08099863030',1,'United States','Both','six months','Internet','子供の受け入れはありますか？\n2nd grade とkindergarten に通う子供がいますが、学校の授業についていけず、学校に行くのが苦痛なようで、かわいそうです。\n私も全く英語が話せないので、3人で通いたいのですが、受け入れ可能ですか？',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-19 20:22:39','2022-03-19 20:22:39'),(355,'semih tiroglu','semihtrgl@gmail.com','05384744037',0,'Turkey','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hello, due to the high exchange rates in Turkey, I get quotes from all companies in Los Angeles, I want to take a 2 month English language course in the summer, can i know your lower price.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-19 23:00:51','2022-03-19 23:00:51'),(356,'江口凜','egu.sachi.rin.ren.123@gmail.com','09045932300',0,'Japan','Both','six months','An agent','2022年8月上旬前後で2週間、短期留学を検討しています。\n女子、高校1年生、留学時点で15歳のの予定です。\n午前は学校、午後は近隣のダンススタジオでレッスンを受けられればと思っています。\n寮かホームステイかは迷っていて、留学経験なし、英検3級程度です。\n一度ご相談の機会をいただけますようお願いいたします。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-20 10:32:51','2022-03-20 10:32:51'),(357,'Yelicsa Morocho','morochoyeli@gmail.com','+1 3109024872',0,'Argentina','Both','one year or more','Friend','Hello, my name\'s YI have the j1 visa and it expires in October, I speak basic English, I want to change my status to F1 and continue studying English, please, could you say me the requirements to aply to change to status?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-03-20 19:23:08','2022-03-20 19:23:08'),(358,'Aibulat','aibulatibragimov@yandex.ru','+79173671966',1,'Russia','Both','three months','Internet','Hello, my name is Aibulat, I have a few questions for you:\n1) Do you teach foreign students full