red to be able to enter the course?\n5 - Can I book a spot here in Brazil? Or should I do this the day I get to LA?\n6 - I have a tourist visa, do I need to get a student visa?\n7 - What English levels is the course for?\n\n8 - How is the course leveling done?\n\nRegards',0,'Googleads_PR',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-03 17:21:18','2022-04-03 17:21:18'),(385,'Graciely','fisio.graciely@gmail.com','(424)3967652',1,'Brazil','Westwood','one month','Internet','Hi, I\'m living in Los Angeles a 2 weeks. I\'m with my husband and he has a visa permit working and I\'m to. I\'d like start a English course because it\'s no good like I want. Would I like to know about price for 8 weeks and what I need to start?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-04 22:17:05','2022-04-04 22:17:05'),(386,'Micorek Arthur','arthur.micorek@icloud.com','0631748813',0,'France','Westwood','three months','Internet','Bonjour je vous contacte car je souhaite partir cet été à l\'étranger pour un séjour linguistique. Je ne sais pas vraiment vers qui me tourner mais je suis prêt pour un séjour dépaysant avec les cours inclus.',0,'Googleads_FR',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-06 17:48:07','2022-04-06 17:48:07'),(387,'yanghuan','985571426@qq.com','+8613166368056',1,'China','Both','one month','Internet',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-08 07:40:57','2022-04-08 07:40:57'),(388,'PEDRO ALEJANDRO BOHORQUEZ MUÑOZ','pedrobohorquez12345@gmail.com','3127890454',0,'Colombia','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Cordial saludó.\nMe gustaría saber mas sobre el curso de ingles',0,'Googleads_SP',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-09 13:09:51','2022-04-09 13:09:51'),(389,'samet','samet.batal1903@gmail.com','+90536 954 70 82',0,'Turkey','Hollywood','six months','Internet','hello we would like to apply for english education at los angeles westwood campus, we would be glad if you could  help us. we are three people to desire to learn english',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2022-04-09 17:40:08','2022-04-09 17:40:08'),(390,'Birol Berk Cinucev','berkcinucev@gmail.com','+905388909915