y to Los Angeles from 06/07 for 4 weeks, I want to learn intensive English at your school. Please provide information.\nThis year, 2022, I studied at Miami School for 4 weeks in the summer.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-01-27 12:17:30','2023-01-27 12:17:30'),(987,'zhangkui','trevor_zk@sina.com','0636201478',0,'Thailand','Hollywood','six months','Internet','我想学习地道英语，具体怎样申请和你费用',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-01-28 07:14:04','2023-01-28 07:14:04'),(988,'Tatiane','tatianesantanaribeiro@hotmail.com','11993793600',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Olá, gostaria de saber se vocês tem programa de intercâmbio com duração de duas semanas, gostaria de fazer abril ou maio deste ano',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-01-28 15:43:19','2023-01-28 15:43:19'),(989,'Shalva Kabosnidze','shalva.kabosnidze@mail.ru','+79253404169',0,'Russia','Westwood','three months','Internet','Здравствуйте !\nЯ хотел бы учиться в вашей школе !\nПодскажите , что необходимо для того что бы зачислится в вашу школу , получить I-20 , и какая стоимость обучение iels. Спасибо за помощь )',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-01-30 14:33:09','2023-01-30 14:33:09'),(990,'tatiane','tatianesantanaribeiro@hotmail.com','11993793600',0,'Brazil','Both','three months','Friend','Boa tarde gostaria de fazer intercâmbio de duas semanas.\nAtualmente estou no Brasil e não tenho visto de estudante.\nTenho intenção de iniciar em maio ou Junho,poderiam me auxiliar.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-01-30 19:46:41','2023-01-30 19:46:41'),(991,'Alison Anleu','alisonanleu23@gmail.com','502 (50450373',0,'Other','Hollywood','six months','Internet','Information please',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-02 05:56:21','2023-02-02 05:56:21'),(992,'Raquel','souzaraquel17@yahoo.com','22992846665',0,'Brazil','Both','one year or more','Internet','Gostaria de iniciar um curso presencial.',0,'Googleads_PR',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-02 17:44:15','2023-02-02 17:44:15'),(993,'Garri','garri.iritsyan@yandex.ru','89801032427',0,'Russia','Westwood','six months','Internet','I would like to join the courses.Can I ask you some questions?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-03 15:45:17','2023-02-03 15:45:17'),(994,'Max','mruckert97@gmail.com','2132968433',0,'France','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hi \nHow are you ? \nI m intresting for 1month cours , conversation + accent reduction!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-05 00:44:07','2023-02-05 00:44:07'),(995,'有本智美','aae53amm@yahoo.co.jp','08057220013',0,'Japan','Westwood','three months','Friend','はじめまして2023/4よりUCLAに研究留学予定の有本智美と申します。ＵＣＬＡの方から貴社の寮に関して紹介いただきました。語学学校に通う予定はないのですが、そのような場合でも入居可能なのでしょうか。入居可能な場合は、4月からの空き状況をご教授いただければ幸いです。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-05 23:04:36','2023-02-05 23:04:36'),(996,'Masa','qmwienratmyi@outlook.com','00000000000',1,'Other','Westwood','three months','Internet','Hi, can I please ask you 2 questions? My mother is interested in attending English school for 3-4 weeks to improve her English and is planning to use ESTA. \n\n1. My mother is in her 50s. I assume your students are mainly young, but do you sometime have students in that age range? She is worried if she can fit in the class.\n\n2. About the course to choose, I believe she can take either ESL Program (8:50am-1:15pm) or Conversation Intermediate Program (1:45pm-6:10pm) as both are under 18 hours which meet ESTA criteria. She would like to focus on speaking, but is wondering if her English level is good enough for Intermediate class. Do you offer any online test to check English level in advance?\n\nI appreciate your help. Thank you in advance!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-06 00:48:46','2023-02-06 00:48:46'),(997,'Bettoutia','bettoutiaismahane@outlook.fr','00213799136107',1,'Other','Hollywood','six months','Internet','Je veux étudier pour devenir réalisatrice ou bien artiste ou bien cénariste',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-06 16:46:49','2023-02-06 16:46:49'),(998,'Songeun Lee','songeun2002@ucla.edu','(310) 254-6008',0,'South Korea','Westwood','six months','Internet','Hi, I\'m Songeun Lee. And I have some