r or more','Internet','​Good Morning,\n\nThis is Charlotte, from Love Learning Hub.\n\nWe are an online directory for parents seeking support with a dyslexic child/ren. \n\nOur commitment is to become the number 1 directory for families dealing with dyslexia in the USA within the first year of our launch.\n\nWe\'d like to offer you an invitation to join us on this journey.  We will launch our site in June and are in the process of filling up our directory with therapists dealing with dyslexic kids online and in person in Los Angeles. \n\nAs an introductory offer we are offering 1 year free advertising to 3 tutoring companies in each city and we\'d like you to be one of them.  There is a small registration fee which pays for our team to create your profile on our website and app and in return you will receive 1 year free advertising valued at $240. Please let me know if you\'d like more information and I\'ll send it over to you.\n\nMany Thanks,\n\nCharlotte',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-13 17:15:14','2023-02-13 17:15:14'),(1009,'Fabian arteaga','fabiiarteaga14@gmail.com','3044370613',0,'Colombia','Both','one month','Internet',NULL,0,'Googleads_SP',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-13 22:58:15','2023-02-13 22:58:15'),(1010,'岡田広美','kyungminsoo5@gmail.com','08061490301',0,'Japan','Hollywood','six months','An agent','8月から留学をしたいと考えているのですが、申し込めばその時期に留学を開始できますか。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-15 11:38:58','2023-02-15 11:38:58'),(1011,'Djime Abdoulaye','alidjouma3@gmail.com','60227616',0,'Other','Hollywood','three months','An agent',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-15 20:49:54','2023-02-15 20:49:54'),(1012,'Hugo Cruz Valencia','gplaystore382@gmail.com','5624142634',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Internet','me interesa un curso intensivo de ingles tal vez 3 semanas como mínimo, vivo en US, pero podria ocupar unos 7 u 8 cursos, familia todos, unos son mis hijos esposa hermana e hija',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-02-15 21:00:33','2023-02-15 21:00:33'),(1013,'Jolanta Stachowiak','fructi@g