ember 2023. It is going to be my first visit to the USA.\nI would like to know:\n1. Do I have to pay for the course in advance? If yes, do you have a refund, if I do not get VISA?\n2. How much money do I have on my bank account?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-16 09:05:43','2023-03-16 09:05:43'),(1123,'Марина','mkrokhtina@mail.com','+12139329404',0,'Russia','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Добрый день! У меня начальный уровень, примерно A2. Живу в ЛА. Плохо говорю и плохо понимаю разговорную речь, т.к. недавно приехала. Что Вы мне можете предложить? Готова начать заниматься в ближайшее время. Могу начать на этой или следующей неделе.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-20 19:40:40','2023-03-20 19:40:40'),(1124,'koslowski','corinne.koslowski@orange.fr','0650829640',0,'France','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Ma fille de 15 ans sera à Los Angeles du 15 avril au 1er mai. Est ce possible d\'avoir des cours de conversation uniquement pendant deux semaines?',0,'Googleads_FR_core3',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-21 15:46:48','2023-03-21 15:46:48'),(1125,'Asya','asinka.aorjatsyan@mail.ru','+37477051278',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Internet','please contact me, I want to join your team and learn english',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-22 15:50:50','2023-03-22 15:50:50'),(1126,'Lily Roderick','lily@yourvadelivered.com','830 217 9877',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','An agent','I hope this email finds you well. My name is Lily Roderick from Your VA Delivered, and we specialize in providing top-notch virtual assistant services to help business owners like you save time, streamline tasks, and improve efficiency.\n\nOur virtual assistants are skilled in various areas, such as:\n\nAdministrative support\nSocial media management\nCustomer service\nData entry\nCalendar management\nAnd much more!\n\nI understand that you might have some questions or concerns about how a virtual assistant can benefit your business. I\'d love to have a conversation to learn more about your needs and explore how our services could help you achieve your goals.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-23 21:31:25','2023-03-23 21:31:25'),(1127,'Alper Yakuboglu','Alper_yakuboglu@windowslive.com','01632290431',1,'Germany','Both','three months','Other','Hello Dear Sir/Madam My Name is Alper Yakuboglu , i am A University student and i want to apply to intensive english Course for a 1 or 2 months  in USA but first i need some informations About your Course so i have couple of Questions \n1)    Does your ınstitut have accreditation ? \n2)    What is the intensive Course Prices ? \n3)    How many turks studying in ınstitut ? \n4)    What’s the pre-registration Fee ? \n5)    Whats your visa score ? \n6)    Do you making a Placement test for the course stage ?\n7)   Do your course have any i20 fee ?\n8)   İf i want to change my language course after i came in USA is it possible\n9)  do you sending  i20 form before i make complete payment  for visa conversation  ?\nRegards',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-24 11:44:38','2023-03-24 11:44:38'),(1128,'Alper Yakuboglu','Alper_yakuboglu@windowslive.com','+49 1632290431',0,'Germany','Hollywood','three months','Other','Hello Dear Sir/Madam My Name is Alper Yakuboglu , i am A University student and i want to apply to intensive english Course for a 1 or 2 months  in USA but first i need some informations About your Course so i have couple of Questions \n1)    Does your ınstitut have accreditation ? \n2)    What is the intensive Course Prices ? \n3)    How many turks studying in ınstitut ? \n4)    What’s the pre-registration Fee ? \n5)    Whats your visa score ? \n6)    Do you making a Placement test for the course stage ?\n7)   Do your course have any i20 fee ?\n8)   İf i want to change my language course after i came in USA is it possible\n9)  do you sending  i20 form before i make complete payment  for visa conversation  ?\nRegards',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-24 11:45:22','2023-03-24 11:45:22'),(1129,'Jorge Enrique armero berrio','armeroenrike775@