a expires in September 7th. I want to do change of status and I’m looking for 6 months courses. Can you give me some information about change of status process about courses and sponsor fees? Please reach out me by email because i\'m working during the day. Thank you for your time.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-28 04:41:38','2023-03-28 04:41:38'),(1135,'YAN LI','leeyeon0214@yahoo.co.jp','+818066621521',0,'Japan','Both','six months','Other','Hello,\n        I am a Chinese national, Living & working in Japan as permanent resident.\nDue to my work-related requirement, i want to learn more English as a full-time student for 12month course.\nCould you please let me know the below information?\n\n1. Is there any age limit for get admission in your school (My date of 1986 March 30,1986).\n2. Whether your offering course schedule for full days or only AM or PM shift?\n3. What will be the procedure for get admission.\n4. Is there any school dormitory where i can stayed during my study period & if yes, what will be the monthly accommodation cost.\n5. Is there any other information which will be helpful during my study period.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-28 09:29:03','2023-03-28 09:29:03'),(1136,'HOBIN SONG','hbsong1@gmail.com','4244712560',0,'Other','Westwood','one month','Internet','Now I am living in westwood. \nI would appreciate it if you could let me know the ESL program.\n\nPlease call to me.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-29 15:32:53','2023-03-29 15:32:53'),(1137,'Robert Rutherford','groupescolaurelatifa@gmail.com','00221707156908',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Friend','Dear Sir/Madam,\n\n\nAPPLICATION FOR RECRUITMENT CONTRACT\n\nI am chief consultant in the above name institute Group Scolaire Latifa,\nwe are located in Senegal with a branch office in Ghana and Gambia,our aims is to recruiting student to language\nschools for them to study verious languages such as:\nEnglish, Spanish,French, Portuguese, Lithuanian, Ukrainian,Slovenian, Austria,Turkish,Italy,German,Taiwan,\ndutch,Denish,,Korean and Japanees.\n\nso we are looking for a reliable language institutions to work with,so\nany language institution who need our service can contact us as soon as possible.\n\n\n\nMany thanks\n\n\nDr Robert K. Rutherford\n\nChief Consultant\nGroupe Scolaire Latifa\ngroupescolaurelatifa@gmail.com\n\n+221781089535/703517462',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-29 17:03:41','2023-03-29 17:03:41'),(1138,'Samuel','samuelsbac16@gmail.com','5583988897893',1,'Brazil','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Hello, I would like to make a budget to study English for 4 weeks, starting in July. I\'m from Brazil, I\'m going on vacation from work, and I wanted to take advantage of this time to try to learn a little bit of the language. I\'m writing with the help of google translator, so forgive me for any spelling mistakes. ?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-30 00:11:42','2023-03-30 00:11:42'),(1139,'Carlos Andres RAMIREZ','carlosrescobar1@gmail.com','3102526901',0,'Colombia','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Quisiera tomar dos semanas, muy intensivas, de cursos de inglés a finales de julio. Mi nivel, probablemente, sea B2. Necesitaría, a la vez, un alojamiento privado, preferiblemente en una casa de familia, para el mismo período. Quisiera saber cuál podría ser la intensidad horario y los costos globales del curso y la estadía. Gracias.',0,'Googleads_SP_core1',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-30 04:29:25','2023-03-30 04:29:25'),(1140,'Anastasiia','zazhizhi@gmail.com','7076661199',1,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hi. I live in Hollywood, and I would like to study English right now? Do you have free classes for migrants? Thank you for answer',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-30 19:16:04','2023-03-30 19:16:04'),(1141,'Sean Wataru Nozaki','sean@mliesl.edu','3237080274',0,'Japan','Westwood','six months','Friend','Test',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-03-30 19:52:41','2023-03-30 19:52:41'),(1142,'Asaf Correa','asafcorrea2020@gmail.com','0051-973750341',0,'Spain','Bo