FL courses.\nIf not what course would you offer as a full-time English language studies? How do you help with the visa I-20 process? How much time should I reserve to apply for the visa I-20 before the course date?\nCould you please explain all necessary steps I should take in order to start full-time English language studies?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-25 11:52:23','2023-05-25 11:52:23'),(1226,'Kiara','kiarallorente55@gmail.com','3124343062',0,'Colombia','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Mi pareja y yo estamos interesados en estudiar inglés, quisiéramos más información por favor y cómo sería el proceso de la visa',0,'Googleads_SP_core2',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-26 19:25:21','2023-05-26 19:25:21'),(1227,'Emma Gu','emma.gu.apply@gmail.com','6506138543',0,'Other','Westwood','six months','Internet','Now I am Aupair and have a J1 visa. I live in Portland. My J1 visa will expire on September 22 this year. I lived in LA Before. I want to apply TOEFL class to prepare for my TOEFL exam. I want to apply to your school because I want to move back to LA after my visa gets approved. I can provide a LA address, it is my friend\'s house. I will live there to study for my class.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-26 20:41:59','2023-05-26 20:41:59'),(1228,'Leidy Alfonso','leidyalfonsoromero@gmail.com','57 3108046947',0,'Colombia','Hollywood','six months','Internet',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-28 03:43:51','2023-05-28 03:43:51'),(1229,'Nigora Turdimurotova','study@sayohat-tour.uz','00998882001223',1,'Other','Both','six months','Internet','Dear, Mentor Language Institute administration.\nI am Nigora Turdimurotova, manager of Sayohat Group in Uzbekistan. Our company is engaged in travel, education, visa services, sending people to study abroad, language courses. We have more than 10 years of experience in this field. Today, we have many people who are interested in studying in USA and universities there. In particular, the number of people who want to study language courses in USA is increasing day by day. Many young people who want to study in language courses apply to our company.\nTherefore, we are looking for partners in the same direction from USA. If you are interested in this, let us know your requirements and suggestions.\nBest Regards, \"Sayohat Group\" team.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-28 05:29:41','2023-05-28 05:29:41'),(1230,'Rafael Antonangelo Molina','antonangelo_molina@yahoo.com.br','+5511992077236',0,'Brazil','Both','six months','Internet','Hello,\n\nI\'m Rafael Molina from Brazil. I will be in Los Angeles between September 25th and October 13th with the intention of taking a 3-week English course (between 20 and 30 hours per week).\nMy general goals are to improve my vocabulary and use of this language, as well as to apply it in contexts of social interaction and business.\nI would like to know if the school has options for these objectives and dates. Could you please send me information?\nBased on some tests I performed and interaction with the language, I believe my current level is upper intermediate.\n\nGreetings.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-29 00:08:55','2023-05-29 00:08:55'),(1231,'Marina','vlad2fisher@gmail.com','+66827014501',0,'Thailand','Both','six months','Internet','Hello! My name is Marina, I am writing to you because I want to learn English. \nI need to improve my language level for my professional work.\nPlease let me know which course you recommend me and how can I get form I-20 from you, what do I need for this? \nI wish you a good day, thank you very much for contacting me!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-29 03:30:15','2023-05-29 03:30:15'),(1232,'Thon Chanvannak','chanvannakthon.tcv16@gmail.com','+85592746146',1,'Other','Westwood','one year or more','Internet','chanvannakthon.tcv16@gmail.com',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-05-30 00:11:00','2023-05-30 00:11:00'),(1233,'Zhaniya Mussayeva','janemk30@gmail.com','87089128888',1,'Kazakhstan','Both','six months','Internet','Здравствуйте, я хотела бы узнать по пов