 will be attending school in Victoria, Canada, starting from this September. \n\nIn the meantime, he needs to learn English as a beginner. I would like to inquire if you still have any vacancies available from Monday, July 10th? \n\nAlthough he has an F-1 visa, he will be entering the US as a traveler.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 01:07:49','2023-06-27 01:07:49'),(1275,'伊濱　茜','akane28i@yahoo.co.jp','09092040092',0,'Japan','Hollywood','one month','An agent','子供が来月末からWestwood校の寮を利用するのですが、設備や準備する物ついて数点お伺いします。\n寮では自炊という説明とお米の無料提供があるとのことですがお米と炊飯器が置いてあり寮生が洗って炊くということで合っていますか？\nお米や炊飯器の数は十分にありますでしょうか？\n冷蔵庫については共有の物が一つあるのでしょうか。\n\nドライヤーは持参した方が良いですか？\n\n寮にWi-Fiは有りますか？\n\nまたご回答の方をよろしくお願いいたします。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 07:46:34','2023-06-29 07:46:34'),(1276,'Sander manzoli','therion.forever@hotmail.com','+55-11-972873165',0,'Brazil','Westwood','one month','Internet','Hi,\nMy wife (48) will spend a month in LA in august/spetember, in a friend\'s house, and she\'s looking fwd to improve her speaking/listening through an english school as well, during evenings, 4 weeks. Seems your \"Conversation program\" fits like a glove, Westwwod campus is just 15min from her house.\n\nThe $298/week price is also for this program? Or the conversation program costs less?\nDoes it include everything (but taxes)? Or a book must be purchased? How much would it cost? We need to know the total cost for the 4-week conversation program.\n\nThank you so much,\nSander\n+55-11-972873165 (whatsapp)',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:17:47','2023-06-29 14:17:47'),(1277,'Firuze','firuzepoyraz@gmail.com','+14243030464',1,'Turkey','Westwood','one month','Internet','I want to take 1 on 1 english classes in person to improve my speaking. I am currently in Los Angeles\nDo you provide that?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 00:58:16','2023-07-02 00:58:16'),(1278,'Fernanda','fernandasaude@live.com','61999955393',1,'Brazil','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Gostaria de saber se tem curso para quem quer começar do 0',0,'Googleads_PR_core2',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 00:07:07','2023-07-03 00:07:07'),(1279,'Gazell Bohlouli','gazell_119@yahoo.com','+41792472042',1,'Switzerland','Westwood','one month','Internet','Dear Sir or Madam, \nI would like my daughter to do a 2 or 3 week course to learn English. She is 10 years old and can just few word in English.  do you have courses for children who don\'t speak english?  At Westwood or Hollywood or somewhere near to s. Monica? We will be in Los Angeles for about 2 or 3 weeks starting July 19th.  \nThank you very much and best regards.\nGazell',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:25:29','2023-07-04 13:25:29'),(1280,'Paulo Rivera','paulorivera21@gmail.com','0986403710',1,'Other','Westwood','six months','Internet','Hi, my name is Paulo Rivera and I would like to know more about your programs, to see which is the best for me.\n\nI\'ll wait for your message.\n\nThanks',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 21:18:09','2023-07-04 21:18:09'),(1281,'Kate','fortuna9996@mail.ru','6469955091',0,'Russia','Hollywood','one month','An agent','Hi how long is advanced course and how much cost',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 04:48:41','2023-07-05 04:48:41'),(1282,'Michela','monaco13michela@gmail.com','3349957858',0,'Italy','Both','one month','Internet','Salve, stavo pensando di organizzare una vacanza studio per fine agosto inizio settembre… È possibile essere ricontattati? Grazie',0,'Googleads_IT_core2',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 08:50:32','2023-07-07 08:50:32'),(1283,'weiyi xu','tsuiweiyi@gmail.com','+8613621007068',0,'China','Hollywood','one month','Internet','What visa do I need? Do you need my IELTS score',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 05:41:33','2023-07-08 05:41:33'),(1284,'KOJI MATSUZAKI','kouji.cake.espresso.coffee@gmail.com','3108662796',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hello, my name is Koji. I want to transfer another I-20 as soon as possible because I finished OPT on June 30, and I fall in a grace period time now. And I a