 Italy wants to come to the US to learn english and hopefully join your guys\'s school. She wants to join the 48 weeks program. Does she have to pay the full tuition in one payment or she can do monthly payments? How much money does she have to show to get approved for the F1 visa? How many hours per week are the classes? online or in person? \n\nThanks in advance',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-12 04:08:27','2023-07-12 04:08:27'),(1290,'Klaus Masek','masek@runup.com','+4369910413067',0,'Other','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hi,\n\nI would like to do a little bit for my English during my summer vacation,\nbut I only have an ESTA visa. I see on the internet that there is\nan english course \"General English Program For Short Term\" in Los Angeles too, \nI\'m interested in that one. \n\nIs this course also available for 50+ beginners \nand is it possible to book an accommondation (single room) for me?\n\nI would like to book the english course in Los Angeles\nfor 2 weeks starting July 24th, 2023 and pay in advance.\n\nPlease send me a registration form or link and price list\nfor this course, thanks\n\nBest regards\n\nKlaus Masek\nAustria',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-12 13:26:11','2023-07-12 13:26:11'),(1291,'juliana c','castrousechejuliana1956@gmail.com','3245455093',0,'Colombia','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2023-07-13 00:13:26','2023-07-13 00:13:26'),(1292,'森 まりこ','m_mori@myalarm.co.jp','08053792973',1,'Japan','Both','one year or more','Other','ー上場企業複数社が利用中ですー\n\nお世話になります。\nMyAlarm株式会社の森と申します。\n\n今回、貴社の営業課題の解決策を探す手伝いができればと思い、\nご連絡をさせていただきました。\n\n上場企業複数社利用中、アポはAIで取る時代。　\nサービスHP：https://lead-dynamics.com\n※作業時間約3分。予約機能を使えば7000社へアプローチ可能です。\n\n更にアポなし商談システム「ノンアポ」を併用すれば\nhttps://non-appoint.com/\nhttps://non-appoint.com/wp.html\n日程調整不要でその場で商談が可能です。\n\n\nオンラインにて、30分−１時間ほど\nご都合の良いお時間をいただくことは可能でしょうか。\n\n7月24日13時から18時（内30分~1時間）\n7月25日12時から17時（内30分~1時間）\n7月26日12時から17時（内30分~1時間）\n上記でも難しい場合は\n大変お手数ですが下記から入力頂けますと幸いです。\nhttps://calenda