aring from you soon.\n\nKind regards,\n\nRita Scontrino\n\nVice-Director',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-08 15:36:27','2024-04-08 15:36:27'),(2357,'川村裕美','yumi.080652946790807@gmail.com','2242653586',1,'United States','Hollywood','one month','An agent','こんにちは、\n川村裕美と申します、\n今年の２月までハリウッド校に通っていました、\nお伺いしたいことがあり、ご連絡致しました。\n再度、アメリカに戻る予定で\nMLIが発行して頂いている私のセービス期間が残っているかを教えて頂きたいです。\nもし、残っていましたら\nトランスファーを検討しております。\nご連絡お待ちしております。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-09 01:04:33','2024-04-09 01:04:33'),(2358,'森 まりこ','m-mori@myalarm.co.jp','08053792973',1,'Japan','Both','one year or more','Other','【貴社の競合はすでにご利用しているかもしれません。】\nchatGTPなどの\nAI 導入担当者様へ\nーエンプラ・上場企業は既にご利用中ー\n6万円で15アポ取得した事例がございます。\n\nお世話になります。\nMyAlarm株式会社の森と申します。\n\n今回、貴社の新規営業やマーケティングの課題を解決する\nお手伝いができればと思い、ご連絡をさせていただきました。\n\nサービスHP：https://lead-dynamics.com/\n※作業時間3分程度で新規1000社へアプローチ\n\nオンラインにて、30分−１時間ほど\nご都合の良いお時間をいただくことは可能でしょうか。\n\n大変お手数ですが下記から入力頂けますと幸いです。\nhttps://calendar.app.google/fhv4CCcW5NQLoVBx5\n\nご返信お待ちしております。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-09 01:41:00','2024-04-09 01:41:00'),(2359,'Gustavo do Nascimento Soares','gustavo22soares.nacimento@gmail.com','(21) 97075-1378',1,'Brazil','Both','one year or more','Internet','Quero fazer minha história e estudar pra ser alguém na vida',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-09 03:30:57','2024-04-09 03:30:57'),(2360,'Yasmim Bernardo','yasmimbernardo66@gmail.com','+55 35998918897',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet','I would like information about the schorlachip, I don’t know anything about English and I really want to learn from you, thank you in advence',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-09 13:19:07','2024-04-09 13:19:07'),(2361,'Hawa Sako','hawanfalysako2000@gmail.com','0779426311',0,'Swaziland','Hollywood','three months','An agent','Prix',0,'Googleads_FR_core1',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-09 15:29:52','2024-04-09 15:29:52'),(2362,'Mariana Dragos','maraianadragos8@gmail.com','000000000000000',0,'Italy','Westwood','three months','Internet','Gentilissimi,\nmi chiamo Mariana Dragos, ho quasi 24 anni, studio e lavoro; sono nata in Romania ma vivo da sempre in Italia, a Roma.\nScorso anno ho concluso il corso di inglese di livello A2 alla British school ed ora vorrei continuare ad accrescere le mie competenze linguistiche con un esperienza direttamente all\'estero. \nNello specifico, sono interessata a vivere questa esperienza a Santa Monica, ma non trovo nulla di possibilmente economico. \nInvece, andrebbe bene anche Los Angeles, purchè la scuola non sia troppo distante dalla costa, in quanto amo più la vicinanza al mare che alla città; in merito ho ricevuto un preventivo da LanguageBookings.com per andare alla Mentor Language Institute - Westwood Campus, siete voi giusto? è attendibile il preventivo fatto da LanguageBookings? se si, porterò a termine l\'iscrizione visto che è l\'esperienza più vantaggiosa che ho trovato.  \nResto in attesa di un vostro gentile riscontro.\nCordiali saluti\n\nMariana',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 10:50:01','2024-04-10 10:50:01'),(2363,'Rita Scontrino','enquiry@englishconversationclub.info','393494034716',0,'Italy','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Dear all,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing from ECC Agency in  Genoa, Italy.\n\nWe have received a quite urgent enquiry from a student wants  to attend a IELTS/TOEFL/CPE/CAE preparation course (min 20 hours x week) and sit the exam there in Los Angeles this Summer 2024 (I will confirm you the period as soon as I can).\n\nWe would need a quotation for 3 weeks, but also for 4 and 5 weeks in order to offer the experience to other students with other requests too.\n\nThe student in question would like to stay in residence full board, but we would consider also the homestay option (full board).\n\nWe would be glad if you could send  your proposal including the price for the airport return transfer as well. A draft with the social program  would be appreciated.\n\nCould you please let us know if you pay a commission to the agency?\n\nIf you need any other information on this, do not hesitate to ask.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you soon.\n\nKind regards,\n\nAlice',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 12:59:43','2024-04-10 12:59:43'),(2364,'Samanta Alves','samanta_alves1@icloud.com','85997533398',0,'Portugal','Both','six months','Internet','Informações',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 17:06:25','2024-04-10 17:06:25'),(2365,'Onur Anıl İnanlı','onr-anl@windowslive.com','+90(507) 057 53 84',1,'Turkey','Hollywood','six months','Internet','Hello. I want to come from Turkey and learn English at your school. Can I payments monthly or weekly? Also, do you have privileges that can speed up my visa process?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 17:30:14','2024-04-10 17:30:14'),(2366,'Somrashmi Ghosh','somrashmi.1@gmail.com','+919674937216',0,'India','Hollywood','three months','Other','I am from India and I am keen on enrolling in your forthcoming English courses held on campus. I would like to know about the duration, details of \n\'Conversation programs\' and what are the associated fees? I eagerly anticipate your swift and informative response, as I am excited to commence my new journey with your guidance and support. Thank you',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 20:02:59','2024-04-10 20:02:59'),(2367,'Maysa thames','maysathames724@gmail.com','+55 21 97032-9992',1,'Brazil','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-10 20:58:03','2024-04-10 20:58:03'),(2368,'Armando Jose Rodriguez Valdez','armandoj.rodriguez2021@gmail.com','81985181431',1,'Venezuela','Hollywood','six months','An agent','Preciso de informações',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-12 01:11:37','2024-04-12 01:11:37'),(2369,'juciene da silva freitas','jucienedasilvafreitas3@gmail.com','94991174652',0,'Brazil','Both','one year or more','Internet','Oi, me chamo juciene, e queria poder ganhar uma bolsa de estudos internacional, pois amo viajar fora e queria aproveitar essa oportunidade para estudar.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-12 10:31:56','2024-04-12 10:31:56'),(2370,'Tania Iorillo','taniaiorillo8@gmail.com','5511998788418',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','one month','Friend','Hello !\n\nMy name is Tania and I\'m from Brazil - São Paulo and my daughter Fernanda, 24 years old, would like to study English in Los Angeles from June 24th to August 16th.\n\nShe would like to study in the afternoon. She will also study at another English school in the Koreatown neighborhood in the morning and we wanted her to go right after lunch and study at another school and immerse herself in English. You would have a course in the afternoon. Her course ends at 1pm. And we didn\'t want him to study at night.\n\n   Thank you very much for her attention.\n\nYours sincerely\nTania',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-12 19:44:29','2024-04-12 19:44:29'),(2371,'Marie-sainte','mariesaintemorgane9@gmail.com','0744249971',0,'France','Westwood','one month','Internet',NULL,0,'Googleads_FR_core2',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-13 11:33:45','2024-04-13 11:33:45'),(2372,'Heba Salah shawer','salahheba181@gmail.com','01009471430',1,'Egypt','Both','six months','Internet','اريد ان اتحدث اللغه الانجليزيه بطلاقه',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-14 12:39:28','2024-04-14 12:39:28'),(2373,'Vitória','Allankaikybatistadapaz37@gmail.com','97984174925',0,'Brazil','Both','three months','Internet','Olá tenho 14 anos, gostaria de uma bolsa de estudos,sou do Brasil meu nome \ne  Vitória e como vocês já devem saber os estudos daqui não sai muitos bons',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-14 23:43:00','2024-04-14 23:43:00'),(2374,'Hinano Koike','0830tiki@gmail.com','81)09085804347',0,'Japan','Both','three months','Internet','https://mliesl.edu/jp/uclasummercamp/#content-30\nこちらのUCLAサマーキャンプに申し込みをしたく思っております。上記サイトの問い合わせリンクに何度かアクセスしましたが送信できなかったため、こちらに問い合わせをさせていただきました。\n以下の項目について、教えてください。\n２週間の滞在を希望しております。定員については、いずれの期間も余裕はありますでしょうか？また、学生寮について、カレッジ内の場所と、セキュリティ状況、また、レジデンスの名前が分かれば教えてください。\n海外旅行はよく行っておりますが、一人で外国へ行く飛行機は初めてです。空港でのお迎えの状況について心配です。出口をでたら目印があるのか、スタッフの方がお迎えに来ているような状況でしょうか？目印を見失ったときの処置などあれば教えて下さい。それらを確認できれば、すぐに申込させていただきたいです。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-15 04:00:47','2024-04-15 04:00:47'),(2375,'Todd Schroeder','toddfish@gmail.com','8184249161',0,'United States','Hollywood','three months','Internet','My name is Todd Schroeder and I am in the process of welcoming an international student to my home.  His name is Miguel, 20 years old, from Venezuela.  I anticipate him arriving in Los Angeles as early as next month or by the end of June.   He speaks very little English.  I would like to discuss options for enrolling a Spanish speaker in your school and the tuition options.  He will stay with me in North Hollywood and would travel to the school on the LA metro subway.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-15 13:34:33','2024-04-15 13:34:33'),(2376,'Onur','Onur.alkis@hotmail.com','2137946968',0,'United States','Hollywood','one year or more','Other','Hi, my name is Onur.  I\'ve been in Los Angeles for a while.  My English is at a beginner level, I want to improve my English so that I can speak it fluently in my social and business life.  Can you give information about training days, hours and fee?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-16 09:16:43','2024-04-16 09:16:43'),(2377,'Alina','alina.gulumyan@yandex.ru','89286292627',1,'Armenia','Hollywood','three months','Internet','I would like to know about applying for language courses. Can I apply if I am 16 years old? How to apply for training? Can I study with a B1/B2 visa?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-16 16:21:39','2024-04-16 16:21:39'),(2378,'BUM HEE LEE','LEEJACOBKR@GMAIL.COM','5627567988',1,'United States','Both','one month','Internet','I am a J1 visa holder who wants to transfer to a F1',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-16 18:37:07','2024-04-16 18:37:07'),(2379,'Виктория','vichka_koroleva02@inbox.ru','+79521118395',1,'Russia','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Здравствуйте, возможно ли обучение с нуля?',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-16 20:23:14','2024-04-16 20:23:14'),(2380,'Daniel Vasconcelos','daniel@agavos.com.br','11959899039',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Hi,\n\nI have a trip planned to Los Angeles from July 1st to September 20th with the purpose of improving my English. I am researching English courses with up to 3 hours daily for conversation practice.\n\nI have time restrictions and would prefer evening classes, as I will continue working remotely during the day for my clients in Brazil.\n\nFor a better understanding of my profile, I aim to initially develop English for everyday use and then for professional purposes. I am a software engineer and lawyer, 44 years old, and currently at level A2, but I have a good understanding of reading and an advanced vocabulary.\n\nCould you please provide information on which courses would be most suitable for me?\n\nThank you.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-16 20:34:46','2024-04-16 20:34:46'),(2381,'Ismail Sati','ismail@thavco.com','+966 56 6505 564',1,'Saudi Arabia','Hollywood','three months','An agent',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-17 09:36:27','2024-04-17 09:36:27'),(2382,'Kailla Isabella Oliveira da Silva','oliveiramayk85@gmail.com','993772004',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet',NULL,0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-17 19:09:32','2024-04-17 19:09:32'),(2383,'Yasmym Maria de oliveira silva','yasmymmaria4@gmail.com','99985497969',1,'Brazil','Both','one year or more','Internet','Queria muito fazer intercâmbio com um preço assesivel',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2024-04-17 21:08:34','2024-04-17 21:08:34'),(2384,'Tania Iorillo','taniaiorillo8@gmail.com','5511998788418',0,'Brazil','Hollywood','one month','Internet','My name is Tania I am very bad in English and I can\'t understand many things in this site  , so I have somme specific questions . Could you please answer me?\n\nMy daughter Fernanda ( 24 years old) is going to Los Angeles and study English at a  Language school in Koreantown from June 24 to 15 August in the morning. \n\nThese are my questions: \n\n1) Do you have English class 