SL courses? I would like to start as soon as possible. Thank you!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-17 20:09:24','2025-07-17 20:09:24'),(3301,'Alikhan','alikhankua08k@gmail.com','+77085356154',1,'Kazakhstan','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet','Hello! I am an international student from Kazakhstan. I would like to apply to your ESL full-time program at the Hollywood campus starting in September 2025. Please send me information about the next steps, including how to get the I-20 form and the enrollment letter for the F-1 visa. Thank you!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-18 20:39:40','2025-07-18 20:39:40'),(3302,'Georgios Bakaloudis','g.bakaloudis@gmail.com','+393934412109',0,'Italy','Both','one month','Internet','Quotation for private (One to One) lessons, 3/4 Hours per day \nStarting August 11th to August 15th, possibility to continue from August 18th to August 22nd\nBest regards\nGiorgio',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-20 13:34:44','2025-07-20 13:34:44'),(3303,'Mohammed I. Aljunaydil','Mo.Aljunaydil@icloud.com','+966507288277',1,'Saudi Arabia','Westwood','one month','Internet','Dear Mentor Language Institute Team,\n\nI hope you\'re doing well. I am interested in enrolling my wife in your English program at the Westwood campus. Her current English level is A1 (beginner), and she will be on an F-2 visa.\n\nWe would like to know if you offer ladies-only classes or if there are any female-only or more private class options available.\n\nThank you for your time and assistance.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-22 18:36:57','2025-07-22 18:36:57'),(3304,'杨','yankehu777@gmail.com','not',0,'China','Both','six months','Internet','我想先学习英语并进一步提升自己，我想咨询如何申请以及这类语言学校是否好通过',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-27 08:43:11','2025-07-27 08:43:11'),(3305,'Claude Guertin','hanna70553@cneemail.com','0285864644',0,'France','Hollywood','one month','Friend',NULL,0,'Googleads_FR_core1',NULL,NULL,'2025-07-28 07:12:10','2025-07-28 07:12:10'),(3306,'Tania','taniam.rodriguezv97@gmail.com','+57 3166443230