us, plan to start the program in about one month, and learned about MLI through the internet.\nPlease contact me via WhatsApp to discuss the details, including available programs, prices, housing options, and the application process (such as F-1 visa requirements if needed).\nThank you very much, and I look forward to hearing from you soon!\nBest regards,\n[Your Full Name]\n[Your WhatsApp Number with country code]',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-12-19 22:49:34','2025-12-19 22:49:34'),(3663,'Duygu Karabas','duygukarabas@gmail.com','+905056939564',1,'United States','Westwood','one month','Internet','Hello,\n\nI am writing on behalf of my boyfriend, who would like to enroll in a B1 level English course. We have reviewed several schools and were very impressed by Beverly Institute.\n\nWe will be arriving in Los Angeles on December 27, and we will be staying very close to your location. I am writing to you from Istanbul.\n\nHe is a very well-known comedian in Turkey and would like to significantly improve his English. His goal is to study for one month in the most intensive way possible, ideally combining group classes with private English coaching, if available.\n\nHe prefers a speaking-focused approach rather than heavy grammar, as this is how he learns best.\n\nCould you please recommend the most suitable program for him based on these preferences? We would like to complete the enrollment and payment process as soon as possible.\n\nThank you very much in advance.\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nDuygu Karabaş',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2025-12-21 19:22:56','2025-12-21 19:22:56'),(3664,'Corinne Hammond','info@bebizminded.com','2034872857',0,'United States','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet','Hello,\n\nReal-time customer data is key to elevating marketing campaigns, personalizing efforts, and boosting customer engagement. By offering up-to-the-minute insights into customer behaviors and preferences, businesses can create targeted and timely interact