0pm and tomorrow at 2:30pm at the Madnani Theatre in Hollywood. We\'d love to have an international audience who could use a few laughs in this trying time. Students from your school may use code \"ELL\" for 50% off tickets.\n \nWe hope you\'re able to spread the word among your students. Broadway World called the performance \"a master class in how little we need words to tell a vibrant, richly nuanced story\".\n \nhttps://events.thestagecrafts.com/projects/13838?tab=details\n \nLooking forward to seeing you there.\nBest,\nKaren',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-27 23:00:03','2026-03-27 23:00:03'),(4135,'Diana Nistor','diananistor767@yahoo.com','854 588 0808',1,'United States','Hollywood','one month','Internet','Hello,\n\nMy name is Diana Nistor, and I am currently an international student in the United States with an active F-1 status.\n\nI am presently enrolled in an ESL program in New York at Campus Education and I am interested in transferring to your school.\n\nI would like to kindly ask for more information regarding the following:\n\n- Do you accept F-1 transfer students and issue a new Form I-20?\n- Will my F-1 visa remain valid if I transfer to your institution?\n- What are the next available start dates?\n- What is the tuition cost for your program?\n\nI am planning my transfer as soon as possible and would appreciate any guidance on the process and required steps.\nThank you very much for your time, and I look forward to your response.\n\nKind regards,\nDiana Nistor.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-28 00:12:02','2026-03-28 00:12:02'),(4136,'Mete Cemek','drmtcmk@hotmail.com.tr','+905546980313',1,'Turkey','Westwood','three months','Friend','Hello, I’m Mete from Turkey. I’ll come to LA on 27th of May and stay about 1 month. I’m planning to join English course.. I see your ESL vacation program and interested in joining this course. I would appreciated give me more information about course ( starting time, price and payment conditions) thank you',0,'direct',NULL,