26 WEST Short-Term Program (Cohort 16) through ICCE. I am scheduled to begin my language program at MLI Hollywood on January 11, 2027.\n\nI am interested in staying in a shared double room (2-person room) provided by MLI Hollywood, and I would like to ask a couple of questions regarding housing availability.\n\nWhat is the earliest date I can move into the student housing?\n\nWould it be possible to move in a few days before the language program begins?\n\nI am currently planning my flight to Los Angeles, so this information would be very helpful in determining my arrival date.\n\nThank you for your time and assistance. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nJeongon Yu\nWEST Short-Term Program, Cohort 16',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-28 05:20:37','2026-10-28 05:20:37'),(5610,'Giada','giada.moro.008@gmail.com','3342178210',1,'Italy','Hollywood','one year or more','Internet','Vorrei sapere il prezzo per 1 mese al campus hollywood',0,'Googleads_IT_core1',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-29 09:18:11','2026-10-29 09:18:11'),(5611,'Nicole Jochim','n.jochim@t-online.de','+491743013399',1,'Germany','Westwood','three months','Internet','Meine  Tochter (18) möchte ab März 2027 9 Wochen einen Sprachkurs in LA machen. \nAktuell liegt ihr Sprachniveau bei A2. Wichtig ist 1. Intensives Englisch um mindestens auf B1 zu kommen. Also ca. 20 Stunden pro Woche. Ein Freizeitprogramm sowie gleichaltrige Students.\nKönne Sie mir ein Angebot mit den Gesamtkosten inkl. Schulgebühr Bücher etc. zukommen lassen sowie weitere Informationen.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-29 09:42:06','2026-10-29 09:42:06'),(5612,'Panjalika Chakma','ritonbb2015@gmail.com','3236982695',1,'Bangladesh','Hollywood','three months','Internet','Hi Good Morning \nPlease let me know what is prossing',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-29 15:09:50','2026-10-29 15:09:50'),(5613,'Siren','894603790@qq.com','+8618351688095',1,'China','Westwood','three months','Internet','Hello,\n\nI am from China, and I recently learned about your language school through online sources in China. I am very interested in your programs.\n\nI am planning to enroll in a two-month English course and would also like your assistance in arranging homestay accommodation.\n\nYou can contact me via WhatsApp.\n\nThank you, and I look forward to hearing from you!\n\nBest regards,',0,'chatgpt.com',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-30 04:13:44','2026-10-30 04:13:44'),(5614,'Sandra Rodrigues de Lima Neves','sandrarlneves@gmail.com','21980482406',1,'Brazil','Westwood','six months','An agent','Gostaria de orçamento e mais informações para um intercâmbio para minha filha Mariana. \nMariana mora atualmente no Rio de Janeiro, terá 18 anos na data da viagem e já terá terminado o ensino médio. Destino: Los Ângeles, aproximadamente 12 semanas, com ida em abril/2027. Ela não quer se hospedar em casa de família. Seria uma hospedagem em residência com outros estudantes, de preferência em quarto compartilhado com outras meninas (caso seja possível) para deixar o valor mais acessível. \nMeu nome é Sandra. Agradeço e fico no aguardo.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-31 20:57:31','2026-10-31 20:57:31'),(5615,'Victor','vlopezt02@gmail.com','5649779958',1,'Mexico','Westwood','three months','Internet','Me gustaría conocer costos con y sin alojamiento por 1 año incluído el costo por el curso por 1 año y conocer paquetes si hay y si puedo iniciar si cuento con visa y pasaporte de turista vigentes',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-01 14:53:06','2026-11-01 14:53:06'),(5616,'Victor','vlopezt02@gmail.com','5649779958',1,'Mexico','Westwood','three months','Internet','Me gustaría conocer costos con y sin alojamiento por 1 año incluído el costo por el curso por 1 año y conocer paquetes si hay y si puedo iniciar si cuento con visa y pasaporte de turista vigentes',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-01 14:54:01','2026-11-01 14:54:01'),(5617,'前川佳奈','kana.miltan@gmail.com','09057754600',1,'Japan','Hollywood','one month','An agent','こんにちは。\n先ほどオンライン申し込みフォームでオンライン申し込みを完了しました、日本在住の前川佳奈と申します。\n2026/11/23から、Hollywood校のConversationコースに3週間だけ通いたいのですが、I-20の発行、ならびに学生ビザの取得は必要なのでしょうか。\nI-20の発行手続きの途中で、course durationの項目で12weeksからしか選択できなかったので、戸惑っています。\nご回答いただけると幸いです。',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-01 16:38:00','2026-11-01 16:38:00'),(5618,'BongKeon Jeon','bkjeon29@naver.com','+82 10 8975 0718',1,'South Korea','Westwood','three months','An agent','*.Could you please let me know as follows :\n\n1. Do you offer an English program for 5th grade students during December 2026 and January 2027?\n2. Is there a program suitable for his age and English level?\n3. What are the exact class dates and daily schedule?\n4. What is the total tuition for four weeks, including registration and materials?\n5. Will he have opportunities to practice conversational English with other children?\n6. What documents are required for registration?\n7. Is it permissible to enroll in and attend a 4-week training course under the ESTA Visa Program?\n\nThank you for your time. I look forward to hearing from you.',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-02 13:08:20','2026-11-02 13:08:20'),(5619,'Giovanna','gmedeirosecruz@gmail.com','5537999529600',0,'Brazil','Both','one month','Internet','My wife and I will be visiting California, between December 2026 and January 2027.\n\nWe are interested in taking a English course, mainly focused on conversation and everyday communication.\n\nWe are both adults, beginners in English, and will be traveling with B1/B2 tourist visas.\n\nCould you please provide the following information?\n\n1. Do you offer short recreational English courses compatible with B1/B2 tourist visas?\n2. Can we study together in the same class?\n3. What are the available dates between December 2026 and January 2027?\n4. What are the class schedules and daily hours?\n5. What is the total cost for two adults for four weeks?\n\nWe would prefer classes from Monday to Friday, ideally in the morning.\n\nPlease contact me by email. Thank you!',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-02 19:21:15','2026-11-02 19:21:15'),(5620,'황태희','pangtaehee@naver.com','01086650557',0,'South Korea','Both','six months','Internet','전화상담가능할까요??',0,'direct',NULL,NULL,'2026-11-03 03:10:34','2026-11-03 03:10:34');
